om&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQXXIAm8tM3yZm9o9u7S7g3yozsanMguj09vCbHfCAz0zA&oe=6B0EF6DD"}, {"file_name": "nomad_store_05_target_range.png", "id": "1064370423254991", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825497_1064370433254990_8300007350378005738_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZRw0HN3fiKAQ7kNvwHXsDN7&_nc_oc=AdoKEgDsn8EcOZ8eDFi3rzItq0t_9vGzXOmMEY3QZ2aNri5SDN8Lm3_owzy-yYUSo4I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVd7X3QVD7rBB0vzpLCYzJ6VFMGAQU9wp7x_8i5p910aQ&oe=6B0EF18F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "nomad_shooter_exact_2560x1440_24bit.png", "id": "1650210489964847", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823279_1650210496631513_7793386767145659260_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V9ZEwhmR7sQQ7kNvwF2GBuj&_nc_oc=AdqnDmDVGKbfqrfuqsx_Aoh3bftht4gua_cr2GzVEa7UIPb3wG4MsieLGYyadqj_9V4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQWYFLUE_4u8sbRPFXfW13zUops9az5W_8p18askTj6r8g&oe=6B0EFB27"}, "display_name": "Nomad Shooter", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "sport", "arcade", "training"], "long_description": "# Nomad Shooter\n\nA VR archery challenge that rewards a steady hand, a clean release, and the satisfaction of a true shot. Step into the role of a steppe archer and put your skill to the test.\n\n**Earn Every Shot**\n\nThere are no shortcuts to the next trial. Earn the score you need to advance, learn from every miss, and come back with better timing and a steadier hand. The further you go, the more each shot demands: judgment, patience, and the nerve to release at the right moment.\n\n**Master the Bow**\n\nTrain at your own pace or go for a cleaner run. A master archer guides you, but only you can make the shot.\n\n**Breathe. Draw. Release.**", "short_description": "Draw the bow, make a clean release, and watch your arrow fly true. In Nomad Shooter, you become a